                            <!-- Added 2026-09-14: bulk-delete form for the checkbox column below.
                                 The checkboxes live inside the table's <tbody>, NOT inside this
                                 <form> (nesting the whole table in a <form> here would nest it
                                 inside each row's own single-delete <form>, which is invalid
                                 HTML). Instead, archivedBulkDeleteSubmit() below reads the
                                 checked .archived-row-check boxes and injects hidden ids[]
                                 inputs into THIS form right before it submits. Posts to
                                 /notes/deleteBulk (admin-enforced server-side, see
